@startuml backend_context
title WordRecall - Backend System Context

' Source paths are relative to the repository root.
' API boundary: backend/app/main.py, backend/app/api/router.py,
'   backend/app/api/routes/{auth,account,words,reviews,common_words,health}.py
' Persistence: backend/app/core/database.py, backend/app/models/*.py
' Generation: backend/app/prompt_worker.py,
'   backend/app/services/prompt_jobs/worker.py,
'   backend/app/services/common_word_worker.py,
'   backend/app/llm/{openrouter_review,openrouter_common}.py
' Embeddings: backend/app/embedding_worker.py,
'   backend/app/services/embeddings.py, backend/app/services/reviews/topics.py
' Dictionary: backend/app/services/dictionary.py
' Operations: backend/app/{migrate,export_user}.py
' Client platforms and database deployment: README.md, backend/docker-compose.yml
' Uses standard PlantUML only; no remote includes or credentials are required.

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam ArrowColor #355777
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #EEF4FB
  BorderColor #355777
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #F4F1FA
  BorderColor #685181
}

actor "Learner" as learner
rectangle "WordRecall client\n[External software system]\n\nExpo / React Native\nWeb, iOS and Android" as client

rectangle "WordRecall backend\n[System in scope]\n\nAccounts and authentication\nDictionary lookup and saved words\nScheduled reviews and topic search\nCommon-word practice\n\nFastAPI API + background workers" as backend #DCEEDC

database "PostgreSQL\n[External data store]\n\nAccounts and token hashes\nWords and embedding vectors\nReview schedules and attempts\nQuestion bank, learning progress\nand persistent generation jobs" as postgres

rectangle "OpenRouter\n[External software system]\n\nLanguage-model gateway\nReview sentence generation\nCommon-word question generation" as openrouter

rectangle "Ollama\n[External software system]\n\nEmbedding model server\nSaved-word and topic vectors" as ollama

actor "Operator / deployment automation" as operator

learner --> client : Registers, saves words,\npractises and manages account
client --> backend : JSON over HTTP(S): /api/v1\nAuth, account, words, reviews, common words\nBearer access token; browser refresh cookie\nor native refresh token
backend --> postgres : Reads and writes application data\nClaims jobs and stores generated results\nSQL via SQLAlchemy / psycopg
backend --> openrouter : Sends word + meaning or word exclusions;\nreceives generated sentences / questions\nHTTPS JSON: POST /chat/completions\nBackground prompt worker
backend --> ollama : Sends saved-word text / topic query;\nreceives embedding vectors\nHTTP(S) JSON: POST /api/embed\nAPI topic search + embedding worker
operator --> backend : Runs migration / export CLIs;\nchecks GET /health over HTTP(S)

note bottom of backend
  Local dictionary: WordNet corpus + LemmInflect.
  Authentication is implemented by the backend.
  Workers belong to this system; jobs persist in PostgreSQL.
end note

legend bottom
  Scope: the implemented backend and its direct environment, not a deployment topology.
  Arrows identify the caller; labels describe request and response data.
  PostgreSQL and model servers sit outside the backend application boundary.
  Ollama review generation also exists as a standalone CLI; the prompt worker uses OpenRouter.
  /health reports API liveness without checking database or provider connectivity.
endlegend
@enduml
